      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "Google's Genie 4 world model: \"Scene: A Victorian high tea. Character: A mouse in appropriate garb.\"\n\n\"A porcupine walks by\"\n\n\"The mouse grows wings\"\n\n\"It flies\"\n\nThis is realtime & I can walk around freely.\n\nIt is glitchy, but also impossibly advanced compared to where we were a couple years ago.",
